4. TERNARY PACKING PROJECTION  (the methods-line win)
==============================================================================
  naive 2-bit packing (FTerViT ships ~2.11)    2.000 bits  ->  5.51 MB
  base-3 packing, 5 weights / byte             1.600 bits  ->  4.41 MB
  Shannon floor, log2(3), uniform              1.585 bits  ->  4.37 MB
